+## OpenRouter image adapter
+
+The gateway maps image generation and editing to OpenRouter Chat Completions.
+Edit requests send the prompt and the reference images as message content.
+The gateway accepts `images`, `image_url`, or `image_data_uri` in that
+precedence order. Configure a model with image input and output for editing.
